**CSS :**
```css
.carte {
  width: 200px;
  height: 300px;
  perspective: 1000px;
}

.carte-inner {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  position: relative;
  transition: transform 0.6s;
  transform-style: preserve-3d;
}

.carte:hover .carte-inner {
  transform: rotateY(180deg);
}

.carte-front, .carte-back {
  position: absolute;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  backface-visibility: hidden;
